 "notes": "min_quote_dist floors the ambient density draw at g ticks from the ref anchor and gates the repost/fill-repost channels: a vacancy inside the no-quote band stays dead. Touch-forming classes (crown, join, improve, chase) are exempt \u2014 they operate at whatever touch the floor establishes. This is the behavioral channel the tape's standing spread needs: makers that never quote inside a minimum depth band, not a placement-law shape. Measured: g8 under SplitFlow@2 enters the tape band (23.8 ticks \u2014 the campaign's first spread-pin hit), while empty overshoots (0.76 vs 0.663 edge) and the iid cells respond non-monotonically \u2014 the floor opens the spread but does not yet compose with emptied-touch.",
